ragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/55cf102a71203c9c1078136639617116.avif?t=1753275230\" width=615 height=56 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/43e84f05298e0a904e8322759f8aeafb.poster.avif?t=1753275230\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/43e84f05298e0a904e8322759f8aeafb.webm?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/43e84f05298e0a904e8322759f8aeafb.mp4?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave's twisting tunnels, towering chasms, and shifting paths can disorient even seasoned explorers. To avoid getting lost, you'll need to draw your own map\u2014or risk wandering in circles forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/2ef0b8bf3a7d07b14f069bffc1e6d651.avif?t=1753275230\" width=615 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/c5399990e62680c8b14144d8552a9617.poster.avif?t=1753275230\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/c5399990e62680c8b14144d8552a9617.webm?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/c5399990e62680c8b14144d8552a9617.mp4?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While sound is your greatest asset, too much noise can overwhelm your senses. Use your whip wisely, or risk temporary deafness in the heat of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/6c5493328f0e26902551e7ce1a429466.avif?t=1753275230\" width=615 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/7bdb11498e6578a009c9e0c3d782d4b8.poster.avif?t=1753275230\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/7bdb11498e6578a009c9e0c3d782d4b8.webm?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/7bdb11498e6578a009c9e0c3d782d4b8.mp4?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your whip isn't just a weapon; it's a tool for traversal. Swing across chasms, disarm enemies, and strike with precision to gain the upper hand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","developers":["EyeSight"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/header.jpg?t=1753275230","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3388080/1272580835/b65fd4843789172482e5158df0d2c02810dc2374/1753089570/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753092487","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3388080/1272580835/b65fd4843789172482e5158df0d2c02